      "comment": "Thread-safe wrapper for file stream repositioning.\n\nAcquires synchronization lock before seeking, then delegates to __fseek_lk\nfor the actual seek operation. Ensures thread-safe access to FILE structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up SEH frame for exception handling\n2. Acquire synchronization lock on the file stream\n3. Call __fseek_lk to perform the actual seek operation\n4. Release the file stream lock\n5. Return the seek result through SEH epilog\n\nParameters:\n  pFile   - FILE*: Pointer to the FILE structure to seek within\n  lOffset - long: Number of bytes to offset from origin\n  nOrigin - int: Starting position for the offset\n            SEEK_SET (0): Beginning of file\n            SEEK_CUR (1): Current file position\n            SEEK_END (2): End of file\n\nReturns:\n  0 on success, non-zero on failure\n\nLibrary Function: Visual Studio 2003 Release CRT",
