      "comment": "Frees all dynamically allocated memory associated with a thread's Fiber Local Storage data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If pTidData is NULL, exit immediately\n2. Free exception info buffer at offset 0x24 if non-NULL\n3. Free namebuf0 at offset 0x2c if non-NULL  \n4. Free namebuf1 at offset 0x34 if non-NULL\n5. Free tmpnam buffer at offset 0x3c if non-NULL\n6. Free time buffer at offset 0x44 if non-NULL\n7. Free asctime buffer at offset 0x48 if non-NULL\n8. Free multibyte info at offset 0x54 if not pointing to default (g_pDefaultMbcInfo)\n9. Acquire lock 0xd (locale lock), decrement refcount on plocinfo (offset 0x60)\n10. If refcount reaches zero and not default locale, deallocate plocinfo\n11. Acquire lock 0xc (mbcinfo lock), decrement refcount on pmbcinfo (offset 0x64)\n12. Decrement nested refcounts in pmbcinfo sub-structures (offsets 0x2c, 0x34, 0x30, 0x40)\n13. Decrement lconv reference count at pmbcinfo+0x4c+0xb4\n14. If pmbcinfo is not default and refcount is zero, call ___freetlocinfo\n15. Free the _tiddata structure itself\n16. Call SEH epilog and return\n\nParameters:\npTidData (_tiddata*): Pointer to thread-local data structure to free. May be NULL.\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL pTidData: Function exits immediately without action\n- Default locale info (g_DefaultLocInfo at 0x6ff7e080): Not freed, just refcount decremented\n- Default mbcinfo pointer (g_ppDefaultLocInfo at 0x6ff7e0d4): Not freed\n- Default mbc info (g_pDefaultMbcInfo at 0x6ff7e770): Not freed\n\nStructure Layout (_tiddata offsets accessed):\nOffset | Size | Field              | Description\n0x24   | 4    | pExceptInfo        | Exception information buffer\n0x2c   | 4    | pNameBuf0          | Name buffer 0\n0x34   | 4    | pNameBuf1          | Name buffer 1\n0x3c   | 4    | pTmpnamBuf         | Temporary name buffer  \n0x44   | 4    | pTimeBuf           | Time string buffer\n0x48   | 4    | pAsctimeBuf        | Asctime string buffer\n0x54   | 4    | p