      "comment": "Releases the global I/O critical section lock (index 1).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push lock index 1 onto stack\n2. Call AcquireCriticalSectionByIndex (which calls LeaveCriticalSection)\n3. Clean up stack and return\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - This is the counterpart to __lock(1) which acquires the I/O lock\n  - Called at the end of flsall after processing all file streams\n  - Lock index 1 corresponds to the global I/O stream table lock\n  - Must be called after __lock(1) to avoid deadlock",
