      "instructions": ["0x71FB|CMP|dword ptr [0x6ffa714c], 0x3", "0x7202|JNZ|0x6ff5726d", "0x7204|PUSH|EBX", "0x7205|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x7207|CMP|dword ptr [0x6ffa7130], EBX", "0x720D|PUSH|EBP", "0x720E|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [0x6ff75108]", "0x7214|JLE|0x6ff5725b", "0x7216|PUSH|ESI", "0x7217|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [0x6ffa7134]", "0x721D|PUSH|EDI", "0x721E|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [0x6ff750f0]", "0x7224|ADD|ESI, 0xc", "0x7227|PUSH|0x4000", "0x722C|PUSH|0x100000"],
      "comment": "Terminates the Small Block Heap (SBH) allocator and releases all associated resources.\n\nThis is the cleanup counterpart to __heap_init. Called during CRT shutdown to free all\nmemory regions allocated by the SBH system for sub-allocations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if SBH is active (g_dwHeapAllocStrategy == 3)\n2. If active, iterate through all SBH regions (g_dwSbhActiveRegionIndex count)\n3. For each region entry at offset +0x0C in region table:\n   a. Decommit virtual memory (VirtualFree with MEM_DECOMMIT 0x4000, size 0x100000)\n   b. Release virtual address space (VirtualFree with MEM_RELEASE 0x8000)\n   c. Free region header from SBH heap (HeapFree on entry[1])\n   d. Advance to next region (stride 0x14 = 20 bytes per entry)\n4. Free the region table itself from SBH heap\n5. Destroy the SBH heap handle (HeapDestroy)\n\nParameters:\n  None - uses global SBH state variables\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value. All SBH resources are released.\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_dwHeapAllocStrategy (0x6ffa714c) - Heap allocation mode (3 = SBH active)\n  g_dwSbhActiveRegionIndex (0x6ffa7130) - Count of active SBH regions\n  g_pSbhRegionTable (0x6ffa7134) - Pointer to SBH region descriptor table\n  g_hSbhHeap (0x6ffa7148) - Handle to SBH private heap\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x100000 (1MB) - Size of each SBH virtual memory region\n  0x4000 - MEM_DECOMMIT flag for VirtualFree\n  0x8000 - MEM_RELEASE flag for VirtualFree\n  0x14 (20) - Size of each region table entry\n  0x0C (12) - Offset to virtual address in region entry\n  3 - Heap strategy indicating SBH is active\n\nStructure Layout (SBH Region Entry, 20 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field          Description\n  0x00    4     dwUnknown0     Reserved/flags\n  0x04    4     dwUnknown1     Reserved\n  0x08    4     dwUnknown2     Reserved\n  0x0C    4     pVirtualBase   Virtual memory base address (1MB region)\n  0x10    4     pRegionHeader  Pointer to region header (heap-allocated)",
      "tags": ["CALLER_1", "PARAM_0", "CALLEE_3", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
