      "comment": "Stores NLG (Non-Local Goto) exception context for SEH frame notification.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push EBX and ECX onto stack to preserve caller state\n2. Load static NLG context structure base address into EBX (0x6ff7e9ac)\n3. Jump to StoreSehContext to complete context storage\n\nParameters:\n- dwReturnAddress (ECX): Target return address for exception unwinding\n- IMPLICIT in_EAX: Exception code/context value passed via EAX register\n- IMPLICIT unaff_EBP: Current stack frame pointer for unwinding\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value, execution continues at StoreSehContext)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- This is a thunk function that prepares registers and jumps to StoreSehContext\n- Part of Visual Studio C Runtime exception handling infrastructure\n- Called during structured exception handling (SEH) frame setup\n\nStructure Layout (NLG_NOTIFY at 0x6ff7e9ac):\nOffset  Size  Field                  Type   Description\n0x00    4     dwMagic                uint   NLG signature (0x19930520)\n0x04    4     g_dwNlgExceptionCode   uint   Exception code from EAX\n0x08    4     g_dwNlgReturnAddress   uint   Return address from ECX\n0x0C    4     g_dwNlgFramePointer    uint   Frame pointer from EBP\n\nRelated Functions:\n- StoreSehContext: Completes the context storage operation\n- __CallSettingFrame@12: Caller that initiates SEH frame setup",
