      "comment": "Applies FPU control bit modifications with bit 19 protection.\n\nThis wrapper function ensures bit 19 (Reserved FPU control bit) is always cleared\nbefore any control word modification, preventing undefined processor behavior.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Receive new control value and mask from caller via stack parameters\n2. Apply mask 0xFFF7FFFF to clear bit 19 from the mask parameter\n3. Forward sanitized mask and value to UpdateFpuControlBits for actual register modification\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- dwNewValue (uint): New control bit values to apply to FPU control register\n- dwMask (uint): Bit mask identifying which control bits to modify (bit 19 will be cleared)\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value; FPU control word is modified as side effect\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xFFF7FFFF: Mask to clear bit 19 (Reserved FPU control bit that must remain 0)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If dwMask has bit 19 set, it will be silently cleared before processing\n- If dwMask is 0, no bits will be modified in the FPU control register\n",
