      "instructions": ["0xCFC0|PUSH|EBX", "0xCFC1|PUSH|EBP", "0xCFC2|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0xCFC6|PUSH|ESI", "0xCFC7|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0xCFC9|LEA|EBX, [ESI + 0x4]", "0xCFCC|PUSH|EDI", "0xCFCD|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESI + 0x7a8]", "0xCFD3|MOV|EDX, 0x553", "0xCFD8|MOV|ECX, EBX", "0xCFDA|CALL|0x6ff6e0e0", "0xCFDF|PUSH|EBX", "0xCFE0|CALL|dword ptr [0x6ff7504c]", "0xCFE6|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESI + 0x7a0]", "0xCFEC|MOV|EDX, ESI"],
      "comment": "Performs binary search on a sorted resource threshold table to find the resource entry whose threshold is less than or equal to the given value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Acquire critical section lock for thread-safe table access\n2. Initialize binary search bounds: low=0, high=tableSize\n3. Binary search loop:\n   a. Calculate mid = (high - low) / 2 + low\n   b. Compare dwThreshold with table[mid].threshold at offset +4\n   c. If threshold >= entry: low = mid + 1 (search upper half)\n   d. If threshold < entry: high = mid (search lower half)\n4. Result index = searchIndex - 1 (get entry <= threshold)\n5. Validate index is within bounds [0, tableSize)\n6. Return resource pointer from table[resultIndex] or NULL if invalid\n7. Release critical section lock\n\nParameters:\n  pResourceManager - GameResourceManager* containing threshold table at offset 0x7a8 and count at 0x7a0\n  dwThreshold - uint threshold value to search for (IMPLICIT: passed in EBP via stack at ESP+0xC)\n\nReturns:\n  void* - Pointer to resource matching threshold, or NULL if no valid entry found\n\nTable Entry Layout (8 bytes stride):\n  Offset 0x0: void* pResource - pointer to resource data\n  Offset 0x4: uint dwThreshold - threshold value for comparison\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Empty table (count <= 0): Returns NULL immediately\n  - Threshold below all entries: Returns NULL (resultIndex becomes -1)\n  - Threshold at or above highest: Returns last valid entry\n\nThread Safety:\n  Uses CriticalSection at ResourceManager+0x4 for synchronization\n  Calls ValidateCriticalSection at lines 0x553 (before) and 0x566 (after)",
      "tags": ["PARAM_2", "CALLER_2", "CALLEE_3"]
    },
