      "instructions": ["0xE900|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0xE903|PUSH|EBX", "0xE904|PUSH|EBP", "0xE905|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x28]", "0xE909|PUSH|EDI", "0xE90A|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0xE90C|PUSH|EBX", "0xE90D|PUSH|0x6ff77138", "0xE912|PUSH|EBP", "0xE913|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0xE915|CALL|0x6ff5ccb6", "0xE91A|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x30]", "0xE91E|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x34]", "0xE922|PUSH|0x1c", "0xE924|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x10]"],
      "comment": "Finds the PE section containing a given memory address and returns section info.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy default module name string to output buffer\n2. Call VirtualQuery to get MEMORY_BASIC_INFORMATION for target address\n3. Get module handle from AllocationBase (or current module if null)\n4. Get module filename via GetModuleFileNameA\n5. Validate PE signature: check MZ (0x5A4D) and PE (0x4550) magic numbers\n6. Calculate number of sections from PE header\n7. Iterate through IMAGE_SECTION_HEADER array (40 bytes each)\n8. For each section, compare target address against VirtualAddress + max(VirtualSize, SizeOfRawData)\n9. If address falls within section bounds, store 1-based section index and offset\n\nParameters:\n  pTargetAddress (ECX): Address to locate within PE sections\n  IMPLICIT EAX - nPathBufferSize: Size of szModulePath buffer\n  szModulePath: Output buffer for module file path\n  pnSectionIndex: Output 1-based section index (0 if not found)\n  pnOffsetInSection: Output offset within the section\n\nReturns:\n  void (results returned via output parameters)\n  *pnSectionIndex = 1-based section number, 0 if not found\n  *pnOffsetInSection = byte offset from section start\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x5A4D - IMAGE_DOS_SIGNATURE (\"MZ\")\n  0x4550 - IMAGE_NT_SIGNATURE (\"PE\\0\\0\")\n  0x3C   - Offset to e_lfanew in DOS header\n  0x6    - Offset to NumberOfSections in FILE_HEADER\n  0x14   - Offset to SizeOfOptionalHeader in FILE_HEADER\n  0x18   - Size of IMAGE_FILE_HEADER (24 bytes)\n  0x28   - Size of IMAGE_SECTION_HEADER (40 bytes)\n\nStructure Layout (IMAGE_SECTION_HEADER at section loop):\n  Offset  Size  Field             Description\n  -0x08   4     VirtualSize       Virtual memory size\n  -0x04   4     VirtualAddress    RVA of section start\n  +0x00   4     SizeOfRawData     Size on disk\n\nError Handling:\n  - VirtualQuery failure: exits early with default string\n  - GetModuleFileNameA failure: copies default string, exits\n  - Invalid PE signature: exits without updating output params\n  - Address not in any section: exits without updating output params",
