      "api_count": 4,
      "api_calls": ["ValidateAndInitializeNetworkConfig", "EnqueueLogMessage", "ValidateAndInitializeNetworkConfig", "EnqueueLogMessage"],
      "instructions": ["0xF710|PUSH|EBP", "0xF711|MOV|EBP, ESP", "0xF713|AND|ESP, 0xfffffff8", "0xF716|SUB|ESP, 0x2d4", "0xF71C|PUSH|EDI", "0xF71D|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0xF71F|MOV|ECX, 0xb3", "0xF724|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x8]", "0xF728|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0xF72A|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EBP + 0x8]", "0xF72D|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x8]", "0xF731|PUSH|EAX", "0xF732|PUSH|ECX", "0xF733|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], 0x10007", "0xF73B|CALL|dword ptr [0x6ff75028]"],
      "comment": "Captures thread context and logs diagnostic register information for network initialization.\n\nThis function retrieves CPU register state from a target thread and enqueues diagnostic\nlog messages containing the stack pointer (ESP) and instruction pointer (EIP) values.\nThe CONTEXT structure is initialized to zero before use, then populated by GetThreadContext\nwith current CPU register values. The retrieved register values are then logged with\nappropriate context information for debugging network startup issues.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate and zero-initialize CONTEXT structure (716 bytes) on stack\n2. Set ContextFlags field to 0x10007 (CONTEXT_FULL | CONTEXT_CONTROL) to request all registers\n3. Call GetThreadContext API to capture current CPU register state from hThread\n4. Initialize network configuration context for Stack Bytes logging category\n5. Queue log message containing ESP (stack pointer) register value with size 0x1000\n6. Initialize network configuration context for Code Bytes logging category\n7. Queue log message containing EIP (instruction pointer) register value with size 0x20\n8. Clean up stack frame and return to caller (RET 0x4 for __stdcall)\n\nParameters:\n  hThread (HANDLE) - Valid thread handle for context capture via GetThreadContext API\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value. Results queued in system logging infrastructure.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - CONTEXT structure is 716 bytes on stack; alignment maintained by AND ESP, 0xFFFFFFF8\n  - Magic value 0x10007 combines CONTEXT_FULL (0x10000) and CONTEXT_CONTROL (0x0007)\n  - ESP located at offset 0x38 within CONTEXT; loaded via [EBP + 0xD4]\n  - EIP located at offset 0x3C within CONTEXT; loaded via [EBP + 0xEC]\n  - Loop counter counts down from 0xB3 (179 iterations) for 716-byte clear operation\n  - Called from InitializeNetworkThreadEntry during network subsystem startup",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "CALLER_1", "CALLEE_3", "PARAM_1"]
    },
