      "comment": "Enumerates all modules loaded in a process using PSAPI and builds a sorted linked list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load psapi.dll dynamically using LoadLibraryA\n2. Get function pointers for EnumProcessModules, GetModuleFileNameExA, GetModuleBaseNameA, GetModuleInformation\n3. Call EnumProcessModules to get array of module handles (max 256 modules, 0x400 bytes)\n4. For each module handle in the array:\n   a. Call GetModuleInformation to get module base address and size\n   b. Call GetModuleFileNameExA to get full module path (MAX_PATH=260)\n   c. Call GetModuleBaseNameA to get module base name (255 chars)\n   d. Allocate 0x210 byte structure via Ordinal_10042 (Fog memory allocator)\n   e. Copy filename and basename into structure at offsets 0x0 and 0x104\n   f. Store base address and size at offsets 0x204 and 0x208\n   g. Insert node into linked list sorted by base address (ascending order)\n5. Free psapi.dll with FreeLibrary\n6. Return head of linked list or NULL on error\n\nParameters:\nhProcess - HANDLE to target process for module enumeration\n\nReturns:\nvoid* - Pointer to head of sorted linked list of module info structures\n        NULL if psapi.dll load fails or all modules enumerated successfully (after cleanup)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns NULL immediately if LoadLibraryA fails for psapi.dll\n- Returns NULL and logs error if any PSAPI function pointer is NULL\n- Limits to 256 modules max (0x100); logs warning if exceeded\n- Returns EBX (linked list head) after freeing library and calling cleanup function\n\nStructure Layout (0x210 bytes):\nOffset  Size    Field               Description\n0x000   0x104   szModuleFilename    Full path to module (MAX_PATH)\n0x104   0x100   szModuleBaseName    Base name of module\n0x204   0x004   dwBaseAddress       Module base address in memory\n0x208   0x004   dwModuleSize        Size of module in bytes\n0x20C   0x004   pNextNode           Pointer to next node in linked list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x400 = 1024 bytes = max module handle array size (256 * sizeof(HMODULE))\n0x100 = 256 = max modules to enumerate\n0x210 = 528 = size of module info structure\n0x472 = 1138 = allocation tag passed to Ordinal_10042\n0x104 = 260 = MAX_PATH for Windows\n0xFF = 255 = max basename length",
      "tags": ["SRC_Exceptions.cpp", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "CALLER_1", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "CALLEE_7", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_StatList", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Skill", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
