      "comment": "Iterates through a linked list of ModuleInfoNode structures and logs each module's details.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Attempt primary module list enumeration via EnumerateProcessModulesAndBuildSortedList (uses implicit EAX parameter)\n2. If primary lookup returns NULL, fall back to EnumerateProcessModules with pFallbackNode parameter\n3. Store first valid node pointer (pFirstNode) for return value\n4. Iterate through linked list while current node pointer is non-NULL\n5. For each node, call LogAppendFormat with module base address, size, name, and path\n6. Advance to next node via pNext field at offset +0x20c (ModuleInfoNode linked list pointer)\n7. Return pointer to first node in list (the initial successful result)\n\nParameters:\n- pFallbackNode (ModuleInfoNode*): Fallback node pointer used if primary enumeration returns NULL\n- IMPLICIT in_EAX (dword): Context parameter passed to EnumerateProcessModulesAndBuildSortedList\n\nReturns:\n- ModuleInfoNode*: Pointer to first node from successful enumeration (either primary or fallback)\n- NULL: If both EnumerateProcessModulesAndBuildSortedList and EnumerateProcessModules return NULL\n\nStructure Layout (ModuleInfoNode - 532 bytes / 0x214):\nOffset   Size   Field        Type          Description\n+0x104   256    szName       char[256]     Module name string buffer\n+0x204   4      dwSize       dword         Module size in bytes\n+0x208   4      pszPath      char*         Pointer to module path string\n+0x20c   4      pNext        ModuleInfoNode* Pointer to next node in linked list\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Single-node lists have pNext = NULL at offset +0x20c\n- Format string used: \"Base:%08lXh Size:%7lXh Name:%-15.15s Path:%s\"\n- The implicit EAX parameter comes from caller context (not visible in stack params)",
