      "comment": "Iterates through a linked list of loaded modules and loads debug symbols for each.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get first module node from pModuleList via IterateNetworkNodesAndInitialize\n2. Log \"Load symbols...\" header message via LogAppendFormat\n3. For each module in the linked list:\n   a. Copy module name from node->szModuleName to local buffer szModuleName[260]\n   b. Copy module path from node->szModulePath to local buffer szModulePath[260]\n   c. Extract dwBaseAddress and dwModuleSize from node structure\n   d. Call g_pfnSymLoadModule(hProcess, NULL, szModuleName, szModulePath, dwBase, dwSize)\n   e. If g_fSuppressSymbolLog is clear (zero):\n      - On failure: Log \"Error (%d) loading symbols for '%s'\" with GetLastError code\n      - On success: Log \"Symbols Loaded for '%s'\" with module path\n   f. Advance to next node via node->pNextNode link\n4. Return pointer to first module node\n\nParameters:\n  pModuleList (ModuleInfoNode*): Pointer to head of module linked list structure\n\nReturns:\n  ModuleInfoNode*: Pointer to first module node in list, or NULL if list is empty\n\nStructure Layout (ModuleInfoNode, 528 bytes):\n  Offset  Size   Field           Type        Description\n  0x000   260    szModuleName    char[260]   Module filename (null-terminated)\n  0x104   260    szModulePath    char[260]   Full module path (null-terminated)  \n  0x204   4      dwBaseAddress   uint        Module base address in memory\n  0x208   4      dwModuleSize    uint        Size of loaded module in bytes\n  0x20c   4      pNextNode       void*       Pointer to next node (linked list)\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n  g_pfnSymLoadModule (0x6ff9afb4): Function pointer to SymLoadModule from imagehlp.dll\n  g_fSuppressSymbolLog (0x6ff9af20): Flag to suppress symbol loading log output\n\nError Handling:\n  On SymLoadModule failure, logs error with Windows error code from GetLastError\n  Continues processing remaining modules even if one fails",
