      "comment": "Initializes the debug symbol handler by loading imagehlp.dll and resolving all required\nfunction pointers for stack trace generation and symbol resolution.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if already initialized (g_fDebugSymbolsInitialized) - return TRUE if so\n2. Initialize critical section for thread-safe symbol operations\n3. Call SwapNLGDwCode to set up exception handling\n4. Load imagehlp.dll dynamically via LoadLibraryA\n5. Resolve 14 required function pointers via GetProcAddress:\n   - SymCleanup, SymFunctionTableAccess, SymGetLineFromAddr\n   - SymGetModuleBase, SymGetModuleInfo, SymGetOptions\n   - SymGetSymFromAddr, SymInitialize, SymSetOptions\n   - SymLoadModule, SymUnloadModule, StackWalk\n   - UnDecorateSymbolName, SplitSymbols\n6. Validate all function pointers are non-NULL\n7. Create two synchronization events for debug thread\n8. Spawn background thread (ProcessDebugThreadStack) for stack processing\n\nParameters:\n  None - This function takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\n  TRUE (1)  - Initialization successful, all symbols resolved\n  FALSE (0) - Failed to load DLL or missing required functions\n\nError Handling:\n  - Logs \"Missing imagehlp.dll\" if DLL not found\n  - Logs \"Missing functions in imagehlp.dll\" if any GetProcAddress fails\n  - Logs success message when all functions loaded\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_fDebugSymbolsInitialized  - Set to 1 on success\n  g_hImageHlpModule           - Handle to loaded imagehlp.dll\n  g_pfnSymCleanup             - Pointer to SymCleanup\n  g_pfnSymFunctionTableAccess - Pointer to SymFunctionTableAccess\n  g_pfnSymGetLineFromAddr     - Pointer to SymGetLineFromAddr\n  g_pfnSymGetModuleBase       - Pointer to SymGetModuleBase\n  g_pfnSymGetModuleInfo       - Pointer to SymGetModuleInfo\n  g_pfnSymGetOptions          - Pointer to SymGetOptions\n  g_pfnSymGetSymFromAddr      - Pointer to SymGetSymFromAddr\n  g_pfnSymInitialize          - Pointer to SymInitialize\n  g_pfnSymSetOptions          - Pointer to SymSetOptions\n  g_pfnSymLoadModule          - Pointer to SymLoadModule\n  g_pfnSymUnloadModule        - Pointer to SymUnloadModule\n  g_pfnStackWalk              - Pointer to StackWalk\n  g_pfnUnDecorateSymbolName   - Pointer to UnDecorateSymbolName\n  g_pfnSplitSymbols           - Pointer to SplitSymbols\n  g_hDebugStackEvent1         - Event handle for thread sync\n  g_hDebugStackEvent2         - Event handle for thread sync\n  g_hDebugStackThread         - Handle to debug stack processing thread\n\nCalled by: InitializeGameInstance\nThread Safety: Uses critical section for synchronization",
