      "comment": "Finds or creates an entry in a hash table for tracking server connections.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read key value from pdwKeySource (implicit EAX parameter)\n2. Compute bucket index: dwKey % pHashTable->dwTableSize (offset 0x10)\n3. Search linked list at bucket for matching key\n4. If found: Increment reference count and return success\n5. If not found: Allocate 12-byte entry from resource pool\n6. Initialize entry: key, refcount=1, next pointer\n7. Insert at head of bucket's linked list\n\nParameters:\n  IMPLICIT EAX: pdwKeySource - Pointer to uint key value to look up\n  IMPLICIT EBX: pHashTable - Pointer to hash table structure\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success (allocation failure logs but continues)\n\nHash Table Entry Structure (12 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field       Type    Description\n  0x00    4     dwKey       uint    Key value for this entry\n  0x04    4     dwRefCount  uint    Reference count (starts at 1)\n  0x08    4     pNext       uint*   Next entry in bucket chain\n\nHash Table Structure:\n  Offset  Size  Field       Type    Description\n  0x10    4     dwTableSize uint    Number of buckets (for modulo)\n  0x40    4     ppBuckets   uint**  Pointer to bucket array\n\nError Handling:\n  Allocation failure logs error via LogErrorWithContext but does not abort.\n\nSource: ..\\Source\\Fog\\Src\\QServer\\QServer.cpp line 2324 (0x914)",
