      "instructions": ["0x12C40|PUSH|ECX", "0x12C41|PUSH|EBX", "0x12C42|PUSH|EBP", "0x12C43|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x12C45|PUSH|ESI", "0x12C46|PUSH|EDI", "0x12C47|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x12C49|LEA|EBP, [EBX + 0x8b4]", "0x12C4F|MOV|EDX, 0xc4b", "0x12C54|MOV|ECX, EBP", "0x12C56|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDI", "0x12C5A|CALL|0x6ff6e0e0", "0x12C5F|PUSH|EBP", "0x12C60|CALL|dword ptr [0x6ff7504c]", "0x12C66|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x18]"],
      "comment": "Copies player data from game state to destination buffer with thread safety.\n\nPerforms a thread-safe bulk copy of player records from the internal game state\nstructure to an external buffer. Uses critical section locking to prevent data\nraces during the copy operation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate critical section address at pGameState+0x8B4\n2. Validate critical section state with code 0xC4B\n3. Enter critical section for exclusive access\n4. Copy nPlayerCount * 0xB0 bytes from pGameState+0x8CC to pDestBuffer\n   - Uses DWORD-aligned copy (MOVSD.REP) for bulk transfer\n   - Handles remaining bytes with MOVSB.REP\n5. Leave critical section\n6. For each player (if nPlayerCount > 0):\n   - Copy 4-byte value from pGameState+0xBA8+(index*4) to pDestBuffer+0xAC+(index*0xB0)\n   - This copies per-player extended data outside the critical section\n\nParameters:\n  pGameState (ECX) - Pointer to game state structure containing:\n    +0x8B4: CRITICAL_SECTION for player data access\n    +0x8CC: Start of player data array\n    +0xBA8: Extended player data array (4 bytes per player)\n  pDestBuffer (EDX) - Destination buffer to receive player data\n  nPlayerCount (Stack+0x4) - Number of player records to copy\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size  | Field               | Description\n  0x8B4  | 0x18  | criticalSection     | CRITICAL_SECTION for thread safety\n  0x8CC  | var   | playerDataArray     | Player records (0xB0 bytes each)\n  0xBA8  | var   | extendedPlayerData  | Extended data (4 bytes per player)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xC4B  - Critical section validation code\n  0xB0   - Size of each player record (176 bytes)\n  0x8B4  - Offset to critical section in game state\n  0x8CC  - Offset to player data array in game state\n  0xBA8  - Offset to extended player data in game state\n  0xAC   - Offset within player record for extended data field",
      "tags": ["CALLER_0", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3", "CALLEE_3"]
    },
