      "comment": "DivideRoundedUp - Performs rounded-up (ceiling) division\n\nPurpose:\nImplements ceiling division by computing (dividend*8+7)/divisor, where the dividend is implicitly passed in EAX register and divisor is an explicit parameter.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load (EAX*8+7) into EAX using LEA instruction\n2. Sign-extend EAX to EDX:EAX using CDQ\n3. Divide EDX:EAX by nDivisor using IDIV\n4. Return quotient in EAX\n\nParameters:\nEAX (implicit): The dividend value in EAX register before calling\nnDivisor (int): The divisor value, passed on stack at [ESP+0x4]\n\nReturns:\nEAX (int): Ceiling division result = (EAX*8+7) / nDivisor\n\nSpecial Cases:\nNo division-by-zero protection; caller must ensure nDivisor is non-zero\nThe constant 8 and 7 implement mathematical rounding for ceiling division",
