      "comment": "Initialize STORM library configuration and memory management.\n\nSets up the STORM library with configuration state, initializes the memory\nmanager, and configures three internal slots with specific values for\ngame operation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up game path for STORM library using global path string\n2. Set STORM configuration state from dwConfigState parameter\n3. Initialize STORM memory manager with zero parameters (default initialization)\n4. Call configuration initialization thunk with dwConfigValue parameter\n5. Configure slot 2 with buffer size value 0x8000 (32KB)\n6. Store configuration state to global g_dwStormConfigState\n7. Configure slot 1 with value 1 (enabled/active)\n8. Configure slot 3 with value 1 (enabled/active)\n\nParameters:\n  dwConfigState - Configuration state flags for STORM library initialization\n  dwConfigValue - Configuration value passed to initialization thunk\n\nIMPLICIT:\n  ECX - dwConfigState (fastcall convention)\n  EDX - dwConfigValue (fastcall convention)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value (initialization function)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Slot 2 receives special buffer size value 0x8000 (32KB allocation)\n  - Slots 1 and 3 both receive value 1 (likely enable flags)\n  - Configuration state stored globally before slot configuration\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x8000 - Buffer size for slot 2 (32768 bytes = 32KB)\n  0x6ff76fe8 - Address of game initialization path string\n  2 - Slot identifier for buffer size configuration\n  1 - Slot identifier for first enable flag\n  3 - Slot identifier for second enable flag\n  4 - Size parameter passed to SetConfigurationValue (4 bytes = sizeof(uint))\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n  - g_szGameInitPath - Set via SetGamePath call\n  - g_dwStormConfigState - Stores dwConfigState parameter\n  - STORM library internal state - Modified by StormSetConfigState\n  - STORM memory manager - Initialized by InitializeStormMemoryManager\n  - Configuration slots 1, 2, 3 - Set via SetConfigurationValue\n\nFunction Call Sequence:\n  1. SetGamePath(&g_szGameInitPath)\n  2. StormSetConfigState(dwConfigState)\n  3. InitializeStormMemoryManager(0, 0)\n  4. InitializeStormConfiguration(dwConfigValue) - Thunk/recursive call\n  5. SetConfigurationValue(2, &dwBufferSize, 4) - dwBufferSize = 0x8000\n  6. SetConfigurationValue(1, &dwSlotValue, 4) - dwSlotValue = 1\n  7. SetConfigurationValue(3, &dwSlotValue, 4) - dwSlotValue = 1",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "CALLER_0", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "CALLEE_5", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
