      "instructions": ["0x18E80|PUSH|EBX", "0x18E81|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0x18E85|TEST|EBX, EBX", "0x18E87|PUSH|ESI", "0x18E88|JNZ|0x6ff68ebc", "0x18E8A|CALL|0x6ff6c9f0", "0x18E8F|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x18E91|CALL|0x6ff5cc86", "0x18E96|PUSH|ESI", "0x18E97|PUSH|0x6ff77284", "0x18E9C|PUSH|0x4b2", "0x18EA1|PUSH|0x6ff766a3", "0x18EA6|PUSH|0x6", "0x18EA8|CALL|0x6ff6dc10", "0x18EAD|ADD|ESP, 0x14"],
      "comment": "Inserts a case-normalized string key into a sorted binary search tree.\n\nAllocates a 44-byte (0x2C) node, copies up to 32 bytes of the key string,\nnormalizes it to lowercase using g_abCaseTransformTable, stores the current\ncount as a sort index at offset 0x20, and inserts the node into the tree.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pnTreeState is not NULL (fatal error if NULL)\n2. Validate pnTreeState[2] is 0 (tree not locked/initialized twice)\n3. Allocate 44-byte node buffer from resource pool\n4. Zero-initialize the node buffer (11 DWORDs = 44 bytes)\n5. Copy up to 32 bytes from pbKeyString to node\n6. Convert each character to lowercase via lookup table\n7. Store current count (*pnTreeState) at node offset 0x20\n8. Insert node into binary search tree at pnTreeState+0xC\n9. Increment the counter at *pnTreeState\n\nParameters:\n    pnTreeState - Pointer to tree state structure:\n                  [0x00] int nCount - Current entry count (incremented on success)\n                  [0x08] int nLockFlag - Must be 0 or fatal error\n                  [0x0C] void* pTreeRoot - Binary search tree root\n    pbKeyString - Null-terminated string key to insert (max 32 bytes used)\n\nReturns:\n    void - Function does not return a value\n\nError Handling:\n    - NULL pnTreeState: Logs error 0x4B2 and calls fatal exit\n    - Non-zero lock flag: Logs error 0x4B6 and calls fatal exit\n    - Allocation failure: Logs error at line 0x4B9 but continues\n\nMagic Numbers:\n    0x2C (44) - Size of tree node structure\n    0x20 (32) - Maximum key string length\n    0x0B (11) - Number of DWORDs to zero (44/4)\n    0x4B2 (1202) - Error code for NULL state pointer\n    0x4B6 (1206) - Error code for locked/reinitialized tree\n    0x4B9 (1209) - Error code for allocation failure\n\nNode Structure Layout:\n    Offset  Size  Field         Description\n    0x00    32    szKey         Lowercase-normalized key string\n    0x20    4     nSortIndex    Entry index for ordering\n\nSource: ..