      "instructions": ["0x1BE00|PUSH|ECX", "0x1BE01|PUSH|ESI", "0x1BE02|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1BE04|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x1BE06|JNZ|0x6ff6be3a", "0x1BE08|CALL|0x6ff6c9f0", "0x1BE0D|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x1BE0F|CALL|0x6ff5cc86", "0x1BE14|PUSH|ESI", "0x1BE15|PUSH|0x6ff77284", "0x1BE1A|PUSH|0x283", "0x1BE1F|PUSH|0x6ff766a3", "0x1BE24|PUSH|0x6", "0x1BE26|CALL|0x6ff6dc10", "0x1BE2B|ADD|ESP, 0x14"],
      "comment": "Validates an object's integrity and updates its state fields.\\n\\nPerforms three validation checks before modifying state. If any validation fails, logs error and terminates application.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Store object pointer in local variable for later access\\n2. Check if object pointer is NULL; if so, trigger fatal error (code 0x283)\\n3. Read validation field at [pThis+0x48]\\n4. Mask with 0xFFFFFFF0 and compare to magic 0x41737960\\n5. If magic mismatch, trigger fatal error (code 0x284)\\n6. Check bit 0 of validation field for active flag\\n7. If active flag not set, trigger fatal error (code 0x286)\\n8. Retrieve old resource pointer from [pThis+0x3c]\\n9. Deallocate old resource via DeallocateResourcePoolElement\\n10. Store dwNewState1 at [pThis+0x3c]\\n11. Store dwNewState2 at [pThis+0x40]\\n\\nParameters:\\n  this (ECX) - ValidatedObject* pointer to validate and update (IMPLICIT, auto-parameter). Must not be NULL. Object must have valid magic and active flag at offset 0x48.\\n  dwNewState1 - dword value to store at object offset 0x3c (replaces resource pointer)\\n  dwNewState2 - dword value to store at object offset 0x40 (state/flags field)\\n\\nReturns:\\n  void - No return value. Terminates process on any validation failure.\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n  NULL this: Logs error 0x283, calls ShutdownResourcesAndExit, then ReportError(-1)\\n  Invalid magic: Logs error 0x284, same termination sequence\\n  Inactive object: Logs error 0x286, same termination sequence\\n\\nMagic Numbers:\\n  0x41737960 - Object validity magic (masked with 0xFFFFFFF0)\\n  0x283 - Error code for NULL object pointer\\n  0x284 - Error code for invalid magic number\\n  0x286 - Error code for inactive object\\n  0xFFFFFFFF - Fatal error exit code to ReportError\\n\\nStructure Layout (ValidatedObject):\\n  Offset  Size  Field              Type     Description\\n  0x00    60    (reserved)         byte[60] Unknown fields\\n  0x3c    4     pResource          void*    Resource pool element pointer\\n  0x40    4     dwState            dword    State/flags field\\n  0x44    4     (reserved)         byte[4]  Padding\\n  0x48    4     dwValidationFlags  dword    Magic number and active flag (bit 0)",
      "tags": ["API_NETWORK", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "CALLER_0", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3", "SRC_AsyncData.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "CALLEE_6", "STRUCT_Control", "LIB_FOG_ASYNC"]
