      "api_count": 10,
      "api_calls": ["GetReturnAddress", "WSACleanup", "LogErrorWithContext", "GetReturnAddress", "WSACleanup", "LogErrorWithContext", "GetReturnAddress", "WSACleanup", "LogErrorWithContext", "ValidateAndSignalGameEvent"],
      "instructions": ["0x1C010|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0x1C012|PUSH|ESI", "0x1C013|JNZ|0x6ff6c047", "0x1C015|CALL|0x6ff6c9f0", "0x1C01A|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x1C01C|CALL|0x6ff5cc86", "0x1C021|PUSH|ESI", "0x1C022|PUSH|0x6ff77284", "0x1C027|PUSH|0x1df", "0x1C02C|PUSH|0x6ff766a3", "0x1C031|PUSH|0x6", "0x1C033|CALL|0x6ff6dc10", "0x1C038|ADD|ESP, 0x14", "0x1C03B|CALL|0x6ff65930", "0x1C040|PUSH|-0x1"],
      "comment": "Processes an item node and queues it for pending priority updates.\nValidates the item node pointer and its internal magic signature before\nprocessing. If a pending queue is active (g_nPendingQueueDepth > 0), the\nitem is added to the pending queue linked list. Otherwise, the priority\nis updated immediately and the game event is signaled.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pItemNode is not NULL (fatal error if NULL)\n2. Extract node flags from offset 0x48 and validate magic signature (0x41737960)\n3. Validate nItemPriority is <= 0 (positive values are invalid)\n4. Check if pending queue is active (g_nPendingQueueDepth > 0):\n   a. If queue inactive: Update priority at +0x44 if changed, signal game event\n   b. If queue active and item not already queued (bit 3 clear):\n      Save current priority to +0x4c, set new priority at +0x44\n      Set queued flag (bit 3) at +0x48, link item to queue via +0x50\n   c. If queue active and item already queued (bit 3 set):\n      Only update priority at +0x44 if new priority is higher\n\nParameters:\npItemNode     - PendingQueueNode* (ECX) Pointer to item node structure\nnItemPriority - int (EDX) Priority value for the item (must be <= 0)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value. Fatal errors trigger program termination.\n\nStructure Layout (PendingQueueNode at pItemNode):\nOffset  Size  Field              Type    Description\n0x3c    4     pGameObject        void*   Associated game object pointer\n0x44    4     nCurrentPriority   int     Current item priority value\n0x48    4     dwFlags            uint    Node flags (bit 3 = queued, upper bits = magic)\n0x4c    4     nPreviousPriority  int     Saved priority before queueing\n0x50    4     pNextQueued        void*   Next item in pending queue linked list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x41737960 - Node magic signature (upper 28 bits of dwFlags)\n0x8        - Queued flag bit mask (indicates item is in pending queue)\n0x1df      - Error line for NULL pItemNode\n0x1e0      - Error line for invalid magic signature\n0x1e1      - Error line for invalid positive priority\n\nError Handling:\nAll validation failures are fatal and call GetReturnAddress, WSACleanup,\nLogErrorWithContext with severity 6, ShutdownResourcesAndExit, and\nReportError(-1). Function does not return on error.",
      "tags": ["API_NETWORK", "PARAM_2", "CALLER_0", "PROP_NOCALLER", "CALLEE_6"]
    },
