      "comment": "Displays a fatal error message box and terminates the application.\n\nThis function handles critical unrecoverable errors by:\n1. Logging separator lines and building a log header\n2. If source file info is available, logging FILE/LINE information\n3. Formatting the error message using vsnprintf with va_list args\n4. Creating a titled MessageBox with the error details\n5. Performing cleanup (WSACleanup, ShutdownResourcesAndExit)\n6. Terminating the application\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Call __chkstk to allocate 0x3100 bytes of stack space\n  2. Log three separator entries via LogAppendFormat\n  3. Build log header via BuildDiabloLogHeader\n  4. If szSourceFile is not NULL:\n     a. Strip path prefix and format file/line information\n     b. Log the formatted file location\n  5. If szFormatMessage (in EBX) is NULL:\n     a. Get return address and cleanup WSA resources\n     b. Report unrecoverable error 0x7c7 via Ordinal_10028 (Storm FatalError)\n     c. Exit via ReportError(-1)\n  6. Format the error message via __vsnprintf\n  7. Build full error message with location info if available\n  8. Create dialog title as \"<AppName> Error\"\n  9. Copy formatted message to MessageBox buffer\n  10. Append newline suffix to message\n  11. Log the final error message\n  12. Call ShutdownResourcesAndExit for cleanup\n  13. Display MessageBoxA with MB_ICONEXCLAMATION (0x30)\n\nParameters:\n  nLineNumber (ECX) - Source line number where error occurred\n  szSourceFile (EDX) - Path to source file, or NULL if unavailable\n  szFormatString (Stack+0x4) - printf-style format string for error\n  vaArgs (Stack+0x8) - Variable argument list for format string\n\n  IMPLICIT: EBX contains szFormatMessage pointer (format string for vsnprintf)\n\nReturns:\n  Does not return - terminates application after displaying error\n\nStack Frame Layout:\n  Offset     Size   Field              Type         Description\n  -0x3108    8      local_3108         undefined    Phantom stack variable\n  -0x3100    256    szDialogTitle      char[256]    MessageBox caption\n  -0x3000    4095   szFormattedOutput  char[4095]   vsnprintf output buffer\n  -0x2001    1      bNullTerminator    byte         Null terminator marker\n  -0x2000    4096   szFullErrorMessage char[4096]   Complete error with location\n  -0x1000    4092   szMessageBoxText   char[4092]   Final MessageBox text buffer\n  -0x4       4      dwReturnAddress    uint         Return address storage\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x3100 - Total stack allocation size (12544 bytes)\n  0x1000 - Buffer size for formatting (4096 bytes)\n  0x100  - Dialog title buffer size (256 bytes)\n  0x7c7  - Error code for unrecoverable internal error (1991)\n  0x30   - MB_ICONEXCLAMATION flag for MessageBoxA\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n  Ordinal_10028 - Storm.dll FatalError, severity level 6 (critical)\n\nError Handling:\n  If szFormatMessage (EBX) is NULL, reports error code 0x7c7 via \n  Ordinal_10028 and exits immediately with ReportError(-1)",
      "tags": ["API_NETWORK", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "CALLEE_14", "CALLER_1", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_4", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
