      "comment": "Creates and initializes a new socket context structure for network communication.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate lpszSocketAddress is not NULL (fatal error if NULL)\n2. Validate string length is less than 259 (0x103) characters\n3. Allocate 404 (0x194) bytes from resource pool for socket context\n4. Zero-initialize the entire structure (101 DWORDs)\n5. Copy socket address to offset 0x8 (max 260 bytes)\n6. Copy context name to offset 0x128 (or \"UNKNOWN\" if NULL)\n7. Store socket flags at offset 0x10C\n8. Initialize critical section at offset 0x174\n9. Set initial state values (connection state = 2)\n\nParameters:\n  lpszSocketAddress - Socket address/hostname string (max 258 chars, required)\n  dwSocketFlags - Configuration flags stored at context offset 0x10C\n  lpszContextName - Optional identifier string (uses \"UNKNOWN\" if NULL)\n\nReturns:\n  Success: Pointer to initialized socket context structure\n  Failure: NULL if allocation fails\n\nError Handling:\n  NULL address: Logs fatal error at line 0x1FC, calls ReportError(-1)\n  Address too long: Logs fatal error at line 0x1FD, calls ReportError(-1)\n  Allocation failure: Logs error at line 0x1FF, returns NULL\n\nStructure Layout (QSSocket context, 0x194 bytes):\n  Offset  Size   Field           Description\n  0x000   0x8    Reserved        Header/padding\n  0x008   0x104  szAddress       Socket address string (260 bytes)\n  0x10C   0x4    dwFlags         Socket configuration flags\n  0x118   0x4    dwField118      State field (initialized to 2)\n  0x11C   0x4    dwField11C      State field (initialized to 0)\n  0x128   0x40   szContextName   Context identifier string (64 bytes)\n  0x170   0x4    dwField170      State field (initialized to 0)\n  0x174   0x18   CriticalSection RTL_CRITICAL_SECTION for thread safety\n  0x18C   0x4    dwField18C      State field (initialized to 0)\n  0x190   0x4    dwField190      State field (initialized to 0)\n\nSource File: D2QSSocket.cpp",
