      "comment": "Invokes the user-defined SE (Structured Exception) translator callback to convert\nWin32 SEH exceptions into C++ exceptions. Sets up a translator guard frame on the\nexception handler chain before calling the translator.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if this is a validation call (pExceptionRecord == 0x123)\n2. If validation call, store continuation address and return success (1)\n3. Build translator guard frame with handler, security cookie, and context\n4. Save current FS:[0] exception list and install new guard frame\n5. Prepare SEH record structure with exception record and context\n6. Call GetOrCreateTlsContext() to get thread-local storage\n7. Invoke SE translator callback via TLS _NLG_dwCode function pointer\n8. Clear result flag after successful translation\n9. If exception occurred during translation, chain exception lists\n10. Restore original exception list from FS:[0]\n11. Return result code (0 = translated, 1 = validation response)\n\nParameters:\n- pExceptionRecord: Pointer to exception record, or 0x123 for validation call\n- pRegistrationNode: Current exception registration node\n- pContext: Exception context record (CPU state at exception)\n- pDispatcherContext: Dispatcher context for unwinding (opaque)\n- pFuncInfo: Function info structure with exception handling data\n- nCatchDepth: Current catch block nesting depth\n- pMarkerNode: Marker registration node for unwinding\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Validation call acknowledged (continuation address stored)\n- 0: Exception successfully translated via SE translator callback\n\nPhantom Variables (compiler-generated, not renameable):\n- local_10: Stack frame pointer saved for guard frame\n- local_c: Stack pointer saved for guard frame restoration\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x123: Validation sentinel to test if translator is installed\n- 0x6ff71536: Continuation address for validation response\n- 0x74: Offset to _NLG_dwCode translator callback in TLS data\n\nStructure Layout - Translator Guard Frame (pPrevExceptionList to pStoredMarkerNode):\nOffset  Size  Field               Type                   Description\n0x00    4     pPrevExceptionList  uint *                 Previous FS:[0] handler\n0x04    4     pfnGuardHandler     code *                 TranslatorGuardHandler\n0x08    4     dwSecurityCookie    uint                   Stack canary value\n0x0C    4     pStoredFuncInfo     _s_FuncInfo *          Saved function info\n0x10    4     pStoredRegNode      EHRegistrationNode *   Saved registration node\n0x14    4     nStoredCatchDepth   int                    Saved catch depth\n0x18    4     pStoredMarkerNode   EHRegistrationNode *   Saved marker node\n\nStructure Layout - SEH Translation Args (nResult to pSehContext):\nOffset  Size  Field         Type                 Description\n0x00    4     nResult       int                  Translation result flag\n0x04    4     pSehRecord    EHExceptionRecord *  Exception record pointer\n0x08    4     pSehContext   void *               Context record pointer",
